      "text": "Voltaire: \"This agglomeration which was called and which still calls itself the Holy Roman Empire was neither holy, nor Roman, nor an empire.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "04-HOLY-ROMAN-EMPIRE.md#003",
      "path": [
        "04-HOLY-ROMAN-EMPIRE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
