      "text": "**Otto I the Great** (r. 936–973): The key figure. Won Battle of Lechfeld 955 against Magyars — ended the Hungarian raids that had plagued Europe for 60 years. Intervened in Italy. **Pope John XII crowned him emperor on Feb 2, 962 CE** — this is the conventional founding date of the HRE."
    },
    {
