      "text": "**Frederick I Barbarossa** (r. 1155–1190):\n- Crowned emperor by Pope Adrian IV\n- Repeatedly invaded Italy to assert imperial control over Lombard cities\n- Lombard League (formed 1167) defeated him at Legnano 1176\n- Peace of Constance 1183: cities get autonomy; swear nominal fealty\n- Drowned crossing a river in Anatolia on the Third Crusade"
