      "text": "HOHENSTAUFEN COLLAPSE:\n  Frederick II died 1250\n  Son Conrad IV died 1254\n  Grandson Conradin executed 1268 by Charles of Anjou\n  → Hohenstaufen extinct in male line\n  → The Great Interregnum (1254-1273): no effective emperor\n  → Princes used the vacuum to grab powers permanently\n```"
